      "releaseNotes": "• 竞速类游戏体感控制优化\n• 默认控件布局优化\n• 修复已知问题",
      "primaryGenreName": "Utilities",
      "primaryGenreId": 6002,
      "releaseDate": "2025-07-31T07:00:00Z",
      "sellerName": "伟敏 张",
